WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:19.822
Tina: Look! Over there! We’re saved!

2
00:00:19.823 --> 00:00:21.960
Danny: How are we saved?

3
00:00:21.961 --> 00:00:25.666
Tina: We just need to get over there, to higher ground.

4
00:00:25.667 --> 00:00:28.430
Brad: I wish your friend Hopian was here.

5
00:00:28.431 --> 00:00:31.337
He could tell us what to do!

6
00:00:31.338 --> 00:00:33.154
Danny: Ha-ha!

7
00:00:33.155 --> 00:00:35.493
Brad: What are you so happy about?

8
00:00:35.494 --> 00:00:38.969
Danny: Hopian already told me what to do!

9
00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:40.670
Brad: What was it?

10
00:00:40.671 --> 00:00:44.645
Danny: Imagination is the key, remember?

11
00:00:44.646 --> 00:00:49.016
Tina: So, how do we imagine our way over to the trees?

12
00:00:49.017 --> 00:00:51.577
Danny: I guess. . .

13
00:00:51.578 --> 00:00:52.929
Brad: I’ve got it!

14
00:00:52.930 --> 00:00:55.390
Think light thoughts!

15
00:00:55.391 --> 00:00:57.163
Danny: What do you mean?

16
00:00:57.164 --> 00:00:59.553
Brad: Think of the lightest thing you can.

17
00:00:59.554 --> 00:01:03.099
Brad: Imagine that you're a feather or something.

18
00:01:03.100 --> 00:01:05.553
Tina: It might work.

19
00:01:05.554 --> 00:01:12.799
Brad: Let me test it out.

20
00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:24.071
Tina: It’s working!

21
00:01:24.072 --> 00:01:26.002
Brad: I made it! I made it!

22
00:01:26.003 --> 00:01:28.183
We’re going to be safe.

23
00:01:28.185 --> 00:01:30.217
Danny: What did you think of?

24
00:01:30.218 --> 00:01:35.425
Brad: Marshmallows! I imagined that my feet were marshmallows!

25
00:01:35.426 --> 00:01:38.828
Danny: Now I’m hungry.

26
00:01:38.829 --> 00:01:45.841
Tina: It’s my turn!

27
00:01:45.842 --> 00:01:51.662
Brad: Good job! Keep going!

28
00:01:51.663 --> 00:01:53.447
Tina: That was easy.

29
00:01:53.448 --> 00:01:55.003
Great idea, Brad!

30
00:01:55.004 --> 00:01:57.934
It really works.

31
00:01:57.935 --> 00:02:01.227
Brad: Come on, Danny. Your turn.

32
00:02:01.228 --> 00:02:06.821
Danny: This’ll be easy!

33
00:02:06.822 --> 00:02:08.898
Tina: He’ll be here in no time!

34
00:02:08.899 --> 00:02:11.224
You’re really smart, Brad.

35
00:02:11.225 --> 00:02:22.785
Brad: Yeah. I didn’t even need my computer this time.

36
00:02:22.786 --> 00:02:24.453
Tina: Oh no!

37
00:02:24.454 --> 00:02:27.406
Brad: Danny! What’s happening?

38
00:02:27.407 --> 00:02:29.889
Danny: I was thinking of a balloon.

39
00:02:29.890 --> 00:02:35.149
Danny: Then I started to think of a baboon instead!

40
00:02:35.150 --> 00:02:38.578
Brad: Concentrate on the balloon!

41
00:02:38.579 --> 00:02:43.881
Danny: I’m trying!

42
00:02:43.882 --> 00:02:45.625
Brad: Let’s help him.

43
00:02:45.626 --> 00:02:58.128
Brad & Tina: Balloon, balloon, balloon, balloon. . .

44
00:02:58.129 --> 00:03:02.971
Good job, Danny!
